\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O God, Thou bottomless abyss!
\par Thee to perfection who can know?
\par O height immense! What words suffice
\par Thy countless attributes to show?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Unfathomable depths Thou art;
\par O plunge me in Thy mercy's sea!
\par Void of true wisdom is my heart; 
\par With love embrace and cover me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Eternity Thy fountain was, 
\par Which, like Thee, no beginning knew;
\par Thou wast ere time began his race,
\par Ere glowed with star the ethereal blue.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Unchangeable, all-perfect Lord,
\par Essential life's unbounded sea,
\par What lives and moves, lives by Thy word;
\par It lives and moves, and is from Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Greatness unspeakable is Thine,
\par Greatness, whose undiminished ray,
\par When short-lived worlds are lost,
\par When earth and heaven are fled away.
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

